OL,3,GNEWSAParty leader apologises for
OL,4,Awearing headphones during debate
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As I came into the chamber, the debate
OL,7,Fwas winding up and I did slip an AirPod
OL,8,Fon to listen back to a debate I missed.
OL,9,FI then drafted a social media post," he
OL,10,Fsaid.
